      "id": 3,
      "text": "John M. Ferrell and his wife moved from Tennessee to the area in 1839, establishing the first Anglo settlement west of present‑day Snow Lake Shores.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        6,
        7
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
