      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Snow_Lake_Shores%2C_Mississippi",
      "category": "history",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "In 1956, Walter Utley and two partners formed a development group that laid out the residential subdivision that would become Snow Lake Shores.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        14
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Snow_Lake_Shores%2C_Mississippi",
      "category": "history",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "text": "Big Snow Lake was created in 1957 by damming a local stream, turning the area into a resort‑style community centered around the lake.",
